        "title": "Override Method",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Misalnya kita sedang membuat game arcade sederhana dengan musuh dasar dan musuh bos yang lebih tangguh. Bos adalah musuh khusus dengan perilaku yang berbeda.</p><p>Di situlah <strong>method overriding</strong> berguna.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa membuat class <code>Enemy</code> dan membuat class <code>Boss</code> mewarisinya.</p><p>Lalu, dengan menggunakan method overriding, kita dapat mengubah perilaku damage pada class <code>Boss</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Overriding sebuah method menggantikan kode method di superclass dengan kode dari subclass.</p><p>Panggil metode <code>takeHit()</code> dari class <code>Boss</code> untuk melihat apa yang terjadi pada properti <code>hp</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"256\" /><option startIndex=\"256\" endIndex=\"257\" /><option startIndex=\"257\" endIndex=\"266\" /><option startIndex=\"266\" endIndex=\"267\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>boss</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>takeHit()</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk meng-override sebuah method, kita memberinya nama dan parameter yang <em>sama</em> seperti method di superclass.</p><p>Kita dapat menimpa <code>takeHit()</code> dari superclass dengan menulis method yang sama di subclass.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"162\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>takeHit()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Overriding berarti kita dapat memiliki <em>method yang sama</em> di subclass, tetapi <em>menyesuaikan</em> perilakunya sesuai kebutuhan di subclass.</p><p>Saat kita memanggil metode <code>takeHit()</code> pada <code>enemy</code> dan <code>boss</code>, kita akan melihat perilaku yang serupa tetapi hasil yang berbeda.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"238\" /><option startIndex=\"239\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"308\" endIndex=\"312\" /><option startIndex=\"313\" endIndex=\"322\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemy</code>, diikuti oleh <code>takeHit()</code>, lalu <code>boss</code>, <code>takeHit()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita memerlukan perilaku dari method superclass, kita dapat memanggilnya dengan keyword <code>super</code>.</p><p>Ketik keyword yang benar untuk memanggil metode <code>attack()</code> dari class Enemy.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"196\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat melakukan override, kita bisa membangun perilaku subclass. Setelah melakukan serangan biasa, boss bisa memicu gerakan khusus.</p><p>Tambahkan perilaku khusus boss ke metode <code>attack()</code> milik class <code>Boss</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"220\" /><option startIndex=\"221\" endIndex=\"243\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss uses Mega Slam!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console.log</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Boss uses Mega Slam!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita ingin sebuah method di subclass menimpa method dari superclass?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Untuk menyesuaikan method di subclass</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Untuk mengubah metode superclass untuk subclass</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Untuk menyesuaikan method di subclass.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang perlu dimiliki bersama oleh method subclass dan method superclass saat melakukan override?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nama dan parameter</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Isi method</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nama dan parameter.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apakah metode dalam class <code>Bat</code> menimpa metode dari class <code>Enemy</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Bat\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bite(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (target === \" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak, namanya berbeda</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ya, itu memiliki parameter yang sama</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak, namanya berbeda.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kata kunci mana yang kita gunakan saat memanggil metode superclass di subclass?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>super</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>this</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apakah subclass masih bisa menggunakan method superclass asli setelah menimpanya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak, saat memanggil metode tersebut berdasarkan namanya tanpa <code>super</code>, subclass akan menggunakan metode yang menimpa metode tersebut</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ya, subclass secara default menggunakan method superclass, bahkan setelah melakukan overriding</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak, saat memanggil metode tersebut berdasarkan namanya tanpa <code>super</code>, subclass akan menggunakan metode yang menimpa metode tersebut.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 150045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Override <code>draw()</code> dari superclass dengan menulis method yang sama di subclass.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"157\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>draw</code>, diikuti oleh <code>()</code>, lalu <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 150046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil method <code>draw()</code> pada instance <code>AnimatedSprite</code> untuk melihat apa yang terjadi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"215\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mySprite = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mySprite.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>mySprite.draw()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 150047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil method <code>draw()</code> pada <code>sprite1</code> dan <code>sprite2</code> untuk melihat perilaku keduanya yang berbeda.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"198\" /><option startIndex=\"198\" endIndex=\"206\" /><option startIndex=\"245\" endIndex=\"252\" /><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"260\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Sprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite2.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>sprite1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.draw();</code>, lalu <code>sprite2</code>, <code>.draw();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 150048,
